Tanzania postal-directory autocomplete data

Source: https://github.com/mwemanoor/tz-locations
Package: tz-locations 1.0.2 (npm), accessed 2026-10-30.
Upstream source: https://www.tanzaniapostcode.com
Transformation: retain names grouped by parent slugs; deduplicate and sort.
Rebuild: node scripts/build-tanzania-locations.mjs /path/to/tz-locations-1.0.2.tgz

This community-maintained postal directory is not an authoritative current
administrative-boundary registry. It includes postal districts/CBD entries.
Suggestions are optional, not validation. It does not distinguish villages
from hamlets. A separate, non-exhaustive village reference list is maintained
in tanzania-villages.json, with a source URL for every entry. Saved entries
and manual input remain available for all areas, including hamlets.

